  "details": "Unity just crashes sometimes after pressing on \"Upload\" on the game page when i want to update my avatar. Some of my friends has the same anomaly too.\nUnity: 2017.4.28f1 Personal\nSDK: 2019.09.18 12.05\n\nEdit: Looks like its happening when start building, and i open/reopen/maximize some other window, like firefox, and when the build is done i go back to unity, but when i press on upload its crash. (happens at the Optimizing file step)\n\nEdit2: Also if i click on upload before the picture load unity is just freeze.\n\nEdit3: If you uncheck the Futureproof uploading in the sdk, it disappears.",
